{{ }} is for the dynamic content, and anything else outside the braces
are static; if you do not have static content at all, {{}} looks
bizarre indeed. Basically {{}} allows arbitrary R code in it, so you
can achieve whatever R can do, e.g. conditionals, loops, etc. I'm not
sure if this answers your question.

Regards,
